<title>USA: Houston Industries Inc Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Houston Industries Inc Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.98		    $3.44</p>
<p> Net			 240,024		  853,949</p>
<p> Revs		    1,245,819		1,184,938</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  245,889		  247,894</p>
<p>			9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   $1.49		    $4.45</p>
<p> Net			 368,618		1,101,665</p>
<p> Revs		    3,184,003		2,930,019</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  247,664		  247,546</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 net includes gain on sale of subsidiary of $2.49/shr in Q3 and $2.86/shr for nine months.</p>
<p>Nine months 1995 net includes no-recurring charges of $67 million.</p>
<p>Company reported earnings late Friday, after the market closed.</p>
